  _displayName: 'Seraphine''s Quest: The Fallen Radiance'
  _description: Having earned Seraphine's trust, you have learned the fate of her
    brother Aurelian, once a guardian of the First Flame. Consumed by the corruption
    he sought to contain, he now guards the Eastern Altar. Restore the altar's sacred
    lights to summon the Forsaken Warden and defeat him. Seraphine has offered to
    stand beside you in battle. Return to her when the threat is ended.
